Depends: systemd, libonnxruntime-dev | libonnxruntime1.21, libpoppler-cpp-dev | libpoppler-cpp0v5, libre2-dev | libre2-9
Homepage: https://github.com/man-github/laya-daemon
Description: High-Performance Multimodal & Multilingual System 1 Decision Daemon
 Laya Daemon is an independent, carrier-grade, multimodal System 1 decision
 microservice engineered for high-throughput operational environments.
 Designed as a standalone profiling engine or inline proxy companion, it delivers
 ultra-low-latency text classification, dynamic Data Loss Prevention (DLP),
 multi-format document text extraction, and vision OCR in a single unified architecture.
